  "review_conclusions": {
    "exact_pipeline": "Original server.validate_request then byte-exact CompositeEngine(round2-v2/rules.py), with original NativeEngine/native-worker/baseline nativeEngine. Old historical inode/content versions are preserved. No new solver/reader/model settings were added.",
    "full_state_and_question_semantics": "Only state/questions enter prediction. Exact full string, UTF8bytes/hash, original criterion insertion order and literal stdin/stdout frames are retained. Binary choice Yes/No follows historical legal mapping; original noul drops criteria internally and retains uncalibrated similarity-score semantics. Prior source-map noul suggestion is not normative. Internal JS mapping is source-inferred, not separately observed FFI traffic.",
    "oracle_boundary": "Authored IDs/purpose/expectations/input hashes remain outside predict; no DEV/CONF dataset projection or annotation reads. Two exact_word_count proof cases check original functional routing1/0 only; authored semantic correctness is not a score/gate.",
    "runtime_identity": "All17application assets are pinned and hashed:14original TypeSafe files,2BGE assets and original models/manifest.json. Required future actual receipt is native2.4.0, package0.2.0, addon e4db4b945a91b5cb8937765236e180763e8a3f4866b791e0f71a98d0018c289d and original manifest hash. Actual addon+ORT mappings will be observed after ready/requests; no native model receipt has been obtained in this review.",
    "CPU_enforcement": "Supported Linuxx86_64 architecture checked before installing a child-only no_new_privs classic BPF filter. Correct architecture skips kill; syscall203/native and0x400000CB/x32 lead to EPERM; other syscalls allowed. Parent remains unchanged. Native child0,1 mask/NNP/seccomp receipt is written before exec and checked again before addon load. Future threads/exec inherit filter; no actual-denial totals are inferred from kernel behavior.",
    "budget_and_replay": "One durable exclusive reservation before worker Popen; original child remains in owned new worker session; exact PID/startticks/PGID/SID checks guard cleanup.585s worker deadline includes initialization with7s early stop allowance, plus outer15s cleanup under600s. No warmup/health decision/retry/extra phase. Root still must publish and independently admit actual source before runtime.",
    "preservation": "Full native ready frame, every actual write/read line, stderr, complete composite/native-original/baseline100/proof response versions and original error messages are retained. Returned malformed composite values are preserved diagnostically. Partial counter source/completeness and UNKNOWN backend execution are explicit; malformed/temporary raw artifacts are not overwritten.",
    "limits": "Full input delivery does not prove full attention. Original BGE max256tokens and native16KiB state boundary remain unchanged. Host ABI/system dependencies are distinct from17application assets. Network controls are Python/Node public API interposition with persistent fatal flags, not OS network-syscall isolation or compiled-Rust instrumentation. Actual OS thread counts are observed, not asserted to equal2."
  },
